# 示例 1：内心、内切圆与切点垂足
~triangle A B C
I 45 = incenter A B C
D 270 = foot I B C
E 30 = foot I C A
F 150 = foot I A B
!check_perp(I, D, B, C, "ID perp BC");
!check_equal_dist(I, D, I, E, "ID = IE");
!check_equal_dist(I, D, I, F, "ID = IF");

A--B--C--cycle / fill1 / given
incircle A B C / fill2 / circ2
A--I / aux
B--I / aux
C--I / aux
I--D / key
I--E / key
I--F / key
rightanglemark I D C / mark